# Test And Doc Gates

Always run `npm run test` after meaningful behavior changes before claiming the work is done.
Run `npm run guard:ai` after boundary-sensitive or multi-layer changes.

Run `npm run build` when touching:
- TypeScript config
- exports
- startup wiring
- config or env loading

Always update `README.md`, runbooks, or rules when changing:
- required env vars
- runtime behavior
- operator workflow
- mandatory tooling or fallback semantics

Add or update focused tests when changing:
- action flow
- approval flow
- adapter branches
- runtime gating behavior

If you cannot run required verification, say exactly what was not run and why.
